12
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:24,679
ký thuật lợi

13
00:00:24,679 --> 00:00:25,440
rất là lớn

14
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:27,899
sau lối, mình mình nghĩ

15
00:00:27,899 --> 00:00:29,440
